        "original_id": "1a489b66-ad5f-5995-b90f-5cb4660ba13c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alisa Camplin\n- Organizations: Australian Olympic team, Australia at the 2012 Winter Youth Olympics\n- Roles: chef de mission\n- Events: 2002 Winter Olympics, 2012 Winter Youth Olympics\n\nFacts:\n- Alisa Camplin was born on 10 November 1974.\n- Alisa Camplin is an Australian aerial skier.\n- Alisa Camplin won gold at the 2002 Winter Olympics, which was Australia's second-ever Winter Olympic gold medal.\n- For Australia at the 2012 Winter Youth Olympics, Alisa Camplin was to serve as chef de mission.\n- Alisa Camplin was the first woman to be chef de mission of any Australian Olympic team.",
